Hi Chandra,  
 Thank you for reaching out. I appreciate you connecting with me. I’ve attempted to get in touch with several people at Pearl over the past few weeks regarding cancellation and billing, and since I hadn’t been able to get clear resolution, I reached out again through the website.  
